1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,150
You still owe me a book.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,500
I've never taken a book out.

3
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:06,780
Pigeons. Nine years ago.

4
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:07,860
Pigeons.

5
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,860
You renewed it twice.

6
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,340
That's not me.

7
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,940
Read the card.

8
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,640
It's my name.

9
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,120
Where's the book.

10
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:17,200
Here.

11
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,100
You read it every night.

12
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,880
It's on your card.

13
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,360
Then close it.

14
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,540
No.

15
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:26,240
Nine years. Still out.
